Effect: plan.py and the fill tool refuse every change while a file under game/routes is modified or untracked; Zero's mining plan was refused six times from 19:06 to 19:09 UTC (queue.log ENT-115). For about 24 minutes no division could apply a plan change. No ship lost work: every plan applied before stood.
