Fix, done: skill military-turn, step 6 and a pitfall: every edit under game/routes is one script that writes and commits by path in the same call (a later addition is a second such call), and before any wait `git status --short game/routes` prints nothing of mine. The section of the guidebook added after the guard's RESULT line was written so (one call, write and commit).
